1
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:33,300
Shou!

2
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:35,700
Get up!

3
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:37,700
What is it?

4
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:40,700
Your mother is going to
get you a wife, isn't she?

5
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:46,300
How fast the news travels.
Matchmaker Su is indeed a big mouth

6
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,500
And you agreed, didn't you?

7
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:55,700
Are you crazy? Of course not!
I don't even know the girl!

8
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:59,300
It's wishful thinking
on my mother's side

9
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,700
I disapprove of the arrangement too

10
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:04,700
Why?

11
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:08,700
Because I know this girl

12
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:12,300
Why can't I marry her
just because you know her?

13
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:14,300
Because I like her!

14
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:21,300
Just because you like her, you won't
let me marry her? I insist!

15
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:25,700
Are you going to marry her?!
Are you?

16
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:27,700
Just joking...!

17
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:34,300
She's a nice girl,
unlike the other girls I know

18
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:39,300
I can tell you're very fond of her.
You lucky guy. I won't get in your way

19
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:41,300
Make sure you treat her well

20
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:44,500
You must never agree to marry her

21
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:48,700
Relax. A gentleman doesn't steal
other people's loved ones

22
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:49,700
Wu Fuqi!

23
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:56,300
Did you come to make trouble?

24
00:02:56,700 --> 00:03:02,300
I went to a lot of trouble to arrange
the marriage for my brother

25
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:07,500
If you dare sabotage my plan,
you'll get it from me!

26
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,500
You're doing a lot of harm!

27
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:12,700
I'm doing harm?!
What nonsense!

28
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:16,300
It's a happy occasion
I'm arranging for Shou!

29
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:18,300
-Knock it off...
-Be quiet!

30
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:23,700
You can't run other people's lives!
This concerns someone's happiness!

31
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:27,700
I know that.
It concerns Shou's happiness

32
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:31,300
That's why I'm making the arrangement
to ward off all the bad luck

33
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:32,700
Be quiet!

34
00:03:32,700 --> 00:03:36,700
Only a stupid woman like you
would believe that!

35
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:40,700
How dare you say I'm stupid!

36
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:44,700
I must teach you a lesson!

37
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:48,700
Sure! Come and get me!

38
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:52,500
Don't run away!

39
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:57,700
Cool it, Sis. I'll get someone to
beat him to a pulp this minute...

40
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:10,700
I'm sorry, Miss Yu.
I failed to talk the Meis out of it

41
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:18,700
My family has accepted the bride-price.
They'll never call off the wedding

42
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:25,300
Actually, my buddy disapproves of
the marriage arrangement too

43
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:30,300
So? He has no say in the matter

44
00:04:32,700 --> 00:04:37,700
Just because his family is rich,
they can throw their weight about?

45
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:39,700
That's too unreasonable!

46
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:45,300
I may not know all the proprieties,

47
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:48,700
but I really don't want to
get married...

48
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:51,500
What am I going to do...?

49
00:04:55,700 --> 00:05:00,300
Miss Yu, I don't want you to
get married even more so

50
00:05:00,700 --> 00:05:05,300
Brother Fuqi, you don't have to
console me. I know you're a good man

51
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:09,700
But this is all fate

52
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:14,500
Both my sister and I
can't run away from it

53
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:18,700
Don't worry, Miss Yu. Rest assured
I'll think of a way out for you!

54
00:05:18,700 --> 00:05:20,700
They're too much!

55
00:05:20,700 --> 00:05:21,700
Thank you

56
00:06:00,700 --> 00:06:01,700
Your Excellency...

57
00:06:12,700 --> 00:06:14,700
How come there's a earring?

58
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:19,700
Those people must've brought women
here since they feel lonely

59
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:21,700
This is no ordinary earring

60
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:26,500
It looks like a treasure
from the Palace

61
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:28,700
Who would come here?

62
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:31,300
Her Highness?

63
00:06:53,700 --> 00:06:56,700
Brother Xiaotian! Why didn't you
tell me you were coming?

64
00:06:56,700 --> 00:07:02,300
I came at this hour because I've found
an expensive piece of jewellery

65
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:05,700
Does it belong to you?

66
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:12,700
Indeed it does! I was wondering where
I lost it. Where did you find it?

67
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:20,300
I actually found it at a place
where it shouldn't have been

68
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:26,700
Wasn't it found at where I lost it?
Why shouldn't it have been there?

69
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:29,700
You're talking strangely

70
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:35,300
I found it at the arsenal

71
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:39,300
Have you been there?

72
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:43,700
You're making one big round to tell me
I shouldn't have been there?

73
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:46,700
-You really went there?
-Yes. What's the problem?

74
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:50,300
How could you roam about?

75
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:56,700
My father owns the kingdom.
I'm free to go anywhere I like

76
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:04,700
The arsenal is a protected area.
It was dangerous for you to go there

77
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:07,700
Not when Miss Ma was with me

78
00:08:07,700 --> 00:08:12,700
What? Ma Ruyi went with you?

79
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:19,300
Yes. She had to accompany me on my outing
since she was responsible for my safety

80
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:24,700
Your Highness, the arsenal
is a classified place

81
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:30,300
You went there on an outing and
even took an outsider along?

82
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:33,700
Come on, Father sent her
to protect me

83
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:36,700
Besides, she isn't an outsider

84
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:42,700
She's just a lady constable.
What is she capable of?

85
00:08:42,700 --> 00:08:47,300
Don't look down on women.
Miss Ma is shrewd

86
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:52,300
She was able to tell
how powerful the weapons were

87
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:55,700
She even said you had a stock
enough to destroy 10 Ping'an Towns

88
00:08:58,700 --> 00:09:03,300
You've got a good supply of weapons
but are afraid of being found out

89
00:09:03,700 --> 00:09:05,700
Are you plotting some conspiracy?

90
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:06,700
That's nonsense!

91
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:13,700
I'm loyal to His Majesty

92
00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:18,700
How could you believe what you heard
and accuse me irresponsibly?

93
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:23,700
Though we're enjoying peace now,
we must be vigilant

94
00:09:23,700 --> 00:09:27,700
Don't forget our neighbouring
countries are watching us

95
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:31,700
How dare you lose your temper!

96
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:35,700
I only made a remark and
you raised your voice!

97
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:40,700
Leave!
I never want to see you again!

98
00:09:58,300 --> 00:10:00,300
I can't figure it out

99
00:10:00,700 --> 00:10:05,700
Why did Her Highness go to
the arsenal with Golden Swallow?

100
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:10,700
Her Highness likes fun and
is full of funny ideas

101
00:10:10,700 --> 00:10:14,300
Surely her trip to the arsenal
was nothing strange?

102
00:10:14,300 --> 00:10:19,700
But the arsenal is in a remote place.
How did she come to know about it?

103
00:10:19,700 --> 00:10:22,700
You mean someone incited her to go?

104
00:10:22,700 --> 00:10:25,300
Could Golden Swallow have
found out something?

105
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:30,700
Now I remember! I bumped into Golden
Swallow at your residence the other day

106
00:10:30,700 --> 00:10:33,700
She accidentally saw
the map of the arsenal

107
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:36,700
No wonder

108
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:40,300
Please forgive me...!

109
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:45,700
Her Highness is bubbly and guileless

110
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:49,700
I doubt she and Golden Swallow
found out anything

111
00:10:49,700 --> 00:10:51,300
That's right

112
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:58,700
Her Highness may be innocent,
but if she spreads the news around,

113
00:10:58,700 --> 00:11:01,300
we'll be in trouble

114
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:04,700
Though I'm in His Majesty's
good books,

115
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:09,300
many senior officials do not trust me

116
00:11:09,700 --> 00:11:14,700
If they remonstrate with me,
I'll be in the soup

117
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:20,800
Her Highness is fond of you and
listens to everything you say

118
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:22,800
Why don't you make use of that?

119
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,000
You mean I should...

120
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,000
I mean you should...

121
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,000
-Get up and talk
-Thank you

122
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:35,600
Conquer her heart before
you steal the kingdom!

123
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:41,600
His Majesty doesn't have any son, and
Princess Ruining is the apple of his eye

124
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:44,600
If you marry her,
you'll already have half the throne

125
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:51,200
I've been waiting for a chance
to tell her my feelings actually

126
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:57,600
Make the most of her stay
in Ping'an Town, Your Excellency

127
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:58,600
That's right

128
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:06,600
My only worry is, just how much
does Golden Swallow know?

129
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:13,200
And those three good-for-nothings.
We should still guard against them

130
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:19,600
They're always hanging around
Her Highness and getting in our way

131
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:23,200
Why don't we just bump them off?

132
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:27,200
It's just as well.
They should be taught a lesson

133
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:31,600
I suggest we separate Her Highness
from them so that...

134
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:35,200
they'll stop influencing her

135
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:59,600
This is terrible! The guards who
escorted us to Ping'an are missing!

136
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:02,200
Relax, they're just skiving somewhere

137
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,600
I haven't seen them since last night

138
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:09,600
That's strange. They drink occasionally
but they won't go away without permission

139
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:12,600
That's why I'm panicking.
What should we do?

140
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:15,600
I must punish them when they get back

141
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:21,600
What I mean is, neither the guards
nor Golden Swallow are with us

142
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:24,600
Who's going to protect us?

143
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:27,600
-So what should we do?
-Shall we inform the Marquis?

144
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:32,600
Don't talk about him! I'm still angry
with him for shouting at me!

145
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,600
What should we do then?

146
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:39,600
Golden Swallow gave me a lark
before she left

147
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:44,600
She said if there was an emergency,
set the lark free and she'd come

148
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:47,600
Go and inform her at once

149
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:03,200
She's recuperating.
I'd better not disturb her

150
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:15,600
She's most particular about
her looks and...

151
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:18,600
this is the most crucial moment

152
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:25,600
If I disturb her and she becomes
pock-marked, she might take it out on me

153
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:45,600
Your Highness, I've informed Miss Ma

154
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,600
What's the matter?

155
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:50,600
The four bodyguards
are missing for no reason

156
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:56,200
So Her Highness told me to summon
Miss Ma in case something happens

157
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:59,200
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

158
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:06,200
You're such a busy man. Would I dare
trouble you with such a small matter?

159
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:10,200
Who knows,
I might get another scolding

160
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:13,600
I was a little harsh the other night

161
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:18,600
But it was because
I was concerned about Your Highness

162
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:22,600
The fact that your bodyguards
are missing is no small matter

163
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:26,200
Since you're here in Ping'an Town,
it's my responsibility to protect you

164
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:31,400
You're doing it out of obligation.
You don't care about me at all

165
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:37,400
If I didn't care about you, I wouldn't
have put my work aside and come here

166
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:42,600
For your safety, why don't you move
to my place?

167
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:47,600
I'll send my men to protect you.
Only then will I put my mind at ease

168
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:51,200
Let's move to Marquis' place,
Your Highness

169
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,600
Don't hesitate anymore

170
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:57,600
-Hongying, start packing up
-Yes, Your Excellency

171
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,480
Your Highness...

172
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:10,600
We're humans. Let us take a break

173
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:16,200
All right. There's a tea hut up ahead.
We'll have a rest over there

174
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:21,600
A pot of tea, please!

175
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:25,600
Hurry!
We're rushed for time!

176
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,600
Here you are!

177
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:36,600
Quickly eat your fill.
We're moving on right after this

178
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,600
-What's the matter?
-I have a stomachache...

179
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:54,400
My stomach too...!

180
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:10,600
How come it's you, Brother Fuqi?

181
00:17:10,600 --> 00:17:12,600
We're here to help you!

182
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:20,200
Why are you taking the sedan away?
Put it down!

183
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:22,600
Help...!

184
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:30,600
Careful...

185
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,600
I'll do it for you

186
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:46,400
Thank you!

187
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:54,600
It's well fastened...!

188
00:17:54,600 --> 00:18:00,600
Shou, stop walking about. The bride
is about to arrive. Are you ready?

189
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,600
She isn't coming

190
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:04,600
What did you say?

191
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:06,600
Nothing...

192
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:09,200
They're here, Mother!

193
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:14,600
Shou, get ready to kick the sedan!

194
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:17,600
What's the matter?

195
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:21,600
I guess I had too much sweet potato
last night. I'm having the runs

196
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:22,600
Really...

197
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:28,600
Make it snappy!
Go quick!

198
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:30,600
The bride...

199
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:34,600
was stolen halfway!

200
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:41,200
I think the culprit was
the head of hooligans, Wu Fuqi!

201
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:45,600
The constables are here, Mother!

202
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:50,600
Mrs Mei, you've been charged with forcing
marriage on someone. Come with us!

203
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:01,600
I'm Yu Shuangxi, Your Excellency

204
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:08,600
I'm Yu Daxi, Your Excellency

205
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:12,200
What are you looking at,
Your Excellency?

206
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:14,600
None of your business!
On your knees!

207
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:22,600
I've gone through the plaint
you submitted

208
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:28,200
You're so young yet you're forced to
marry against your own will

209
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:32,200
You have my sympathy.
Rest assured I'll stand up for you!

210
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:33,600
Thank you!

211
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,600
-Mrs Mei!
-Yes, Your Excellency

212
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:42,400
You're advanced in age. Why did you
bully such a young and pretty girl?

213
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:47,600
I wouldn't dare do that.
I was actually holding a wedding

214
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:52,600
But he hijacked the sedan halfway and
incited the Yus to change their minds

215
00:19:54,600 --> 00:20:00,200
We all know that you only
look at "evidence" in a trial

216
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:07,600
-I see, so that was what happened
-That's right

217
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:09,600
-Do you have any witness?
-Certainly

218
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:14,600
She's the one. She was at the scene
and saw everything, Your Excellency

219
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:18,600
-What's your name?
-My name is Su Dazui (big mouth)

220
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:22,600
Indeed your mouth is big.
Your words must carry weight then

221
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:25,600
Did you see Wu Fuqi steal the bride?

222
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:28,600
Yes! I may have a big mouth,
but I never lie

223
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:35,200
Wu Fuqi, why are you linked to
everything that happens in Ping'an Town?

224
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:39,600
I was only trying to
uphold justice, Your Excellency

225
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:46,600
What Su Dazui said was true,
but she hid many facts

226
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:54,600
Your Excellency, we all know that
evidence is very important

227
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:02,600
Still, you shouldn't have
stolen the bride!

228
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:07,600
Your Excellency, together with
Su Dazui, the Meis took advantage of...

229
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:12,600
the fact that they were the creditors
and forced Yu Shuangxi...

230
00:21:12,600 --> 00:21:16,600
to marry Mei Shouquan against
her own wishes!

231
00:21:16,600 --> 00:21:21,600
We have lots of evidence,
Your Excellency

232
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:27,600
Still, she has to be
a willing party

233
00:21:27,600 --> 00:21:32,600
We have an agreement on the marriage.
There was no threat involved at all

234
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:35,400
An agreement?

235
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:41,600
Yu Shuangxi, Yu Daxi,
is this agreement authentic?

236
00:21:41,600 --> 00:21:47,600
Indeed it is, but I got a loan from
the Meis because of an emergency

237
00:21:47,600 --> 00:21:52,600
It's only right that you return
the loan. This is their evidence

238
00:21:52,600 --> 00:21:55,600
What more have you got to say?

239
00:21:57,600 --> 00:22:00,200
Yu Shuangxi is to marry into
the Mei family!

240
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:05,600
Wu Fuqi, you'll get 40 strokes as
punishment for disrupting the wedding

241
00:22:07,600 --> 00:22:10,600
We haven't finished yet

242
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:14,600
It's unfair, Your Excellency

243
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:17,600
This is none of your concern.
Go!

244
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:23,600
There's more to the case
than meets the eye

245
00:22:38,600 --> 00:22:40,600
What do you mean?

246
00:22:44,600 --> 00:22:49,600
Your Excellency, Her Highness
allows me to render my service to you

247
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:55,600
I'd like to see everybody live in
peace and there's no unhappiness

248
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:58,600
That's why I'm crying out
against injustice

249
00:22:58,600 --> 00:23:01,600
Nonsense!
What injustice is there?

250
00:23:01,600 --> 00:23:03,600
Precisely!

251
00:23:04,600 --> 00:23:09,600
I heard every word that was said
at the hearing just now

252
00:23:09,600 --> 00:23:14,600
There may be some truth
in the Meis' argument

253
00:23:14,600 --> 00:23:20,600
But there are a few points
they've overlooked

254
00:23:20,600 --> 00:23:23,600
That's not true at all!

255
00:23:23,600 --> 00:23:28,600
Indeed it's true.
You probably didn't read carefully

256
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:35,600
It's written clearly here
the person in question...

257
00:23:35,600 --> 00:23:38,600
is Yu Daxi

258
00:23:38,600 --> 00:23:41,600
But it's Yu Shuangxi
who's made to get married

259
00:23:41,600 --> 00:23:46,200
If this isn't injustice,
what is it then?

260
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:50,200
Where's the logic, Your Excellency?

261
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:55,200
You have a point

262
00:23:55,600 --> 00:24:00,600
But the marriage was approved by the
parents and arranged by a matchmaker

263
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:06,600
Bride price was also given and
all the other customs were observed

264
00:24:06,600 --> 00:24:09,600
How could you say there's injustice?

265
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:13,200
But the name on the agreement
is Yu Daxi

266
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:19,600
So she should be the one marrying
and not Yu Shuangxi

267
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:25,600
Precisely. The Meis actually
got the bride wrong

268
00:24:25,600 --> 00:24:29,600
It's not surprising they gave the
bride price to the wrong person too!

269
00:24:29,600 --> 00:24:34,600
I'm sure all of you have heard of
one selling oneself to be a slave

270
00:24:34,600 --> 00:24:37,600
But have you heard of
one selling oneself to be a wife?

271
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:43,600
If you become a slave, you might
still be able to redeem yourself

272
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:47,600
But if you become a wife,
you can never redeem yourself

273
00:24:47,600 --> 00:24:54,200
So it's unreasonable for Yu Shuangxi
to marry into the Meis' family

274
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:56,600
Exactly!

275
00:24:57,600 --> 00:25:01,600
That's not all, Your Excellency!

276
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:03,600
-It's not all?
-No

277
00:25:04,600 --> 00:25:09,600
The Meis forced the marriage
based on the IOU

278
00:25:09,600 --> 00:25:13,600
That's against the rules
of matchmaking

279
00:25:13,600 --> 00:25:18,600
The Yus are only responsible
for repaying the loan

280
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:23,600
As for the marriage arrangement,
it shouldn't be valid at all!

281
00:25:23,600 --> 00:25:25,600
Please consider, Your Excellency!

282
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:30,600
You mustn't forget all the evidence,
Your Excellency!

283
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:36,600
The evidence is right here,
Your Excellency

284
00:25:36,600 --> 00:25:40,200
Please have a good look at it!

285
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:45,600
Indeed it makes sense

286
00:25:45,600 --> 00:25:48,600
Which part of it makes sense?

287
00:25:50,600 --> 00:25:53,600
All right, the marriage arrangement
is invalid!

288
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:56,600
Thank you!

289
00:25:57,600 --> 00:25:58,600
Thank you!

290
00:25:58,600 --> 00:26:02,200
-Don't you be cocky!
-Please excuse me

291
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:04,200
Court dismiss!

292
00:26:05,600 --> 00:26:07,600
Give me back my things...

293
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:34,600
Lark, why are you back?

294
00:26:34,600 --> 00:26:37,600
You've woken up?
I've been back for hours

295
00:26:37,600 --> 00:26:39,600
Anything the matter?

296
00:26:39,600 --> 00:26:42,600
Something terrible is about to happen
in the mortal world

297
00:27:45,600 --> 00:27:50,400
Thank you, Brother Delu. We wouldn't
have known what to do without you

298
00:27:50,600 --> 00:27:56,600
He's the one who should thank you
for giving him a chance...

299
00:27:56,600 --> 00:27:59,600
to display his talent in court

300
00:28:10,200 --> 00:28:11,200
Brother Fuqi!

301
00:28:18,400 --> 00:28:21,400
-Run for your life, Shuangxi!
-No!

302
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,600
Go!

303
00:28:50,600 --> 00:28:51,600
Lu!

304
00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:55,480
Let's go!

305
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,600
Make way

306
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:55,600
Ruyi!

307
00:31:56,600 --> 00:31:59,200
Ruyi! Are you all right?

308
00:32:00,600 --> 00:32:02,600
It's windy here.
Let's go inside

309
00:32:09,600 --> 00:32:12,200
Are you all right?
Get some rest

310
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:14,600
I must find Her Highness

311
00:32:14,600 --> 00:32:16,200
What's happened?

312
00:32:16,600 --> 00:32:21,600
I once gave her a lark and told her to
send it to me if she was in trouble

313
00:32:21,600 --> 00:32:24,200
The lark went to you,
so you rushed back?

314
00:32:24,600 --> 00:32:28,600
But you're so weak now. How will you
look for her? I'll do it for you

315
00:32:28,600 --> 00:32:32,600
She's no longer at Purple Bamboo Villa.
There were people lying in ambush there

316
00:32:32,600 --> 00:32:34,600
Something is not right

317
00:32:34,600 --> 00:32:39,600
Someone is even trying to harm you,
Wei Delu and Wu Fuqi. You must be careful

318
00:32:39,600 --> 00:32:41,400
What should we do?

319
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:45,600
I've been sapped of my vital energy.
I doubt you can handle this alone

320
00:32:45,600 --> 00:32:48,600
Better go together with your buddies

321
00:32:48,600 --> 00:32:50,600
I'll go this minute

322
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:54,000
-Are you all right?
-Yes...

323
00:32:54,600 --> 00:32:59,600
Good. Just stay here and rest.
Nobody will disturb you

324
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:26,600
So much trouble for nothing!

325
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:31,200
The matter is settled.
Stop harping on it

326
00:33:32,600 --> 00:33:36,400
My knees are still aching
because of the kneeling

327
00:33:36,600 --> 00:33:41,600
Really? Let's go home.
I'll give you a massage

328
00:33:41,600 --> 00:33:43,200
Thanks

329
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:45,200
We're off, Mother

330
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:49,600
Old Madam

331
00:33:49,600 --> 00:33:53,600
Granny, you're back.
Where's Yu-jiejie?

332
00:33:53,600 --> 00:33:59,200
Don't ask. She's not going
to be your aunt anymore

333
00:33:59,600 --> 00:34:02,600
I long knew Uncle doesn't fancy her

334
00:34:02,600 --> 00:34:04,600
Don't spout nonsense

335
00:34:04,600 --> 00:34:08,600
I'm not spouting nonsense.
It's Ma-jiejie he fancies

336
00:34:08,600 --> 00:34:15,200
How could it be? Your uncle shuns her
like a mouse would a cat

337
00:34:15,200 --> 00:34:17,200
Why would he fancy her?

338
00:34:17,600 --> 00:34:23,600
I just saw Ma-jiejie and Uncle
kissing each other

339
00:34:26,600 --> 00:34:28,600
You mustn't talk nonsense

340
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:35,200
It's true. Uncle closed his eyes,
and Ma-jiejie put her lips on his

341
00:34:35,200 --> 00:34:37,200
And then?

342
00:34:37,600 --> 00:34:40,600
And then Uncle carried Ma-jiejie
into his room

343
00:34:40,600 --> 00:34:43,600
And then?

344
00:34:43,600 --> 00:34:49,400
He said, "Let's go inside",
and they haven't come out since then

345
00:34:51,600 --> 00:34:54,400
And after that?

346
00:34:54,600 --> 00:34:57,600
The door was closed.
I couldn't see a thing

347
00:34:57,600 --> 00:35:00,600
Now you mustn't make things up

348
00:35:00,600 --> 00:35:06,200
Every word I said is true.
You can go and ask Ma-jiejie

349
00:35:07,600 --> 00:35:13,600
Don't talk nonsense.
And you mustn't tell anyone about this

350
00:35:13,600 --> 00:35:16,600
Had you not asked me,
I wouldn't have told you

351
00:35:16,600 --> 00:35:18,600
Not another word

352
00:35:18,600 --> 00:35:21,200
-I really...
-Not another word

353
00:35:28,600 --> 00:35:31,400
-It hurts...
-Sorry...

354
00:35:33,600 --> 00:35:39,600
We're really down on our luck.
To think someone is after our lives

355
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:44,600
Luckily I was agile and quick-witted,
or I'd have become a mummy

356
00:35:44,600 --> 00:35:46,600
You two are mummies now

357
00:35:47,600 --> 00:35:51,600
Since childhood, you've always
had someone at your heels

358
00:35:51,600 --> 00:35:56,200
I bet those people were
Joined Brow's men who wanted revenge

359
00:35:56,200 --> 00:35:57,200
Oh yeah?

360
00:35:57,600 --> 00:36:03,200
I'm used to it. But Miss Yu
might have had a terrible scare

361
00:36:03,600 --> 00:36:05,600
Sorry to have scared you

362
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:09,600
I'm all right. But I think those people
weren't just after Brother Fuqi's life

363
00:36:09,600 --> 00:36:12,600
See, you're injured too

364
00:36:14,600 --> 00:36:16,600
Shuangxi has a point

365
00:36:16,600 --> 00:36:22,600
If I were the killers' only target,
how come you were attacked too?

366
00:36:22,600 --> 00:36:27,200
This is strange then.
Tell me who I've offended

367
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:31,200
All of you are here.
Great!

368
00:36:33,600 --> 00:36:36,200
What happened to you?

369
00:36:36,200 --> 00:36:38,200
We just had a narrow escape

370
00:36:38,600 --> 00:36:43,600
So did I! I was lucky
Spicy Woman came to my rescue

371
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:45,600
Someone tried to kill you too?

372
00:36:46,600 --> 00:36:51,600
This is interesting. I think
the killers were after the three of us

373
00:36:51,600 --> 00:36:55,200
Who could they be?
Why did they want you dead?

374
00:36:55,200 --> 00:37:00,200
I think everybody in Ping'an Town
is a suspect

375
00:37:00,600 --> 00:37:02,600
Don't forget we're the three vermins

376
00:37:02,600 --> 00:37:04,600
That makes sense

377
00:37:06,600 --> 00:37:09,600
Hear me out.
It's Her Highness!

378
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:15,600
Not only the three of us are
in danger, so is Her Highness!

379
00:37:16,600 --> 00:37:19,200
Who told you that?

380
00:37:19,600 --> 00:37:21,200
Let go!

381
00:37:22,600 --> 00:37:25,600
It was Ma Ruyi who told me

382
00:37:25,600 --> 00:37:30,600
She said the lark she gave to
Her Highness flew back to her

383
00:37:30,600 --> 00:37:34,400
That's why she suspects something
has happened to Her Highness

384
00:37:35,600 --> 00:37:41,600
Someone was after our blood,
and Her Highness is in trouble

385
00:37:41,600 --> 00:37:45,200
It's too much of a coincidence.
Who have we all offended?

386
00:37:47,600 --> 00:37:50,600
Don't tell me it's...
Ouyang Xiaotian!

387
00:37:52,600 --> 00:37:54,600
It can't be!

388
00:37:54,600 --> 00:38:00,200
You have something against him
because he's your rival

389
00:38:00,600 --> 00:38:06,200
As the marquis, he can just put us
to death. Need he go to such lengths?

390
00:38:06,600 --> 00:38:09,600
What do you mean he's my rival?

391
00:38:09,600 --> 00:38:14,200
I tell you - he has something to hide.
That's why he can't kill us openly

392
00:38:14,600 --> 00:38:16,600
You're just too imaginative

393
00:38:17,600 --> 00:38:22,600
You think I'm imagining things?
Why, you...

394
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:28,600
Don't start fighting with each other!

395
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:31,200
Let's find Her Highness first!

396
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:39,200
I almost forgot. Miss Ma said we're
to save Her Highness once we meet

397
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:43,600
But she also said Her Highness is
no longer at Purple Bamboo Villa

398
00:38:44,600 --> 00:38:49,600
Her Highness is a total stranger here.
Where could she have gone?

399
00:38:50,600 --> 00:38:53,400
Where are we going to find her?

400
00:38:55,400 --> 00:38:57,400
-The...
-Marquis'...

401
00:38:57,400 --> 00:38:58,400
Residence!

402
00:39:01,600 --> 00:39:03,400
Be careful!

403
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:07,400
Ouyang Xiaotian, you liar!

404
00:39:11,400 --> 00:39:13,400
Liar!

405
00:39:15,600 --> 00:39:20,600
-Your Highness, don't do it anymore!
-I insist! Give it to me!

406
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:28,400
Your Highness!

407
00:39:31,600 --> 00:39:36,600
You duped me into coming here and
forbid me to do this and that!

408
00:39:36,600 --> 00:39:38,600
You're stricter than Father!

409
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:44,200
Cool down. You're a princess.
How could you behave like this?

410
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:46,200
Untie them

411
00:39:46,600 --> 00:39:51,200
Am I regarded as a princess here?
Wherever I go, I'm being watched

412
00:39:51,200 --> 00:39:53,200
I feel as if I were a prisoner!

413
00:39:54,600 --> 00:39:58,600
I must say I've neglected you
as I've been rather busy

414
00:39:58,600 --> 00:40:02,600
But I told them to wait on you
wholeheartedly

415
00:40:02,600 --> 00:40:05,600
Your men are all stupid!

416
00:40:05,600 --> 00:40:09,600
When I wanted to go to the temple,
they said it wasn't safe

417
00:40:09,600 --> 00:40:12,600
And they set up an altar here
for me to pray

418
00:40:12,600 --> 00:40:16,600
When I wanted to go to a restaurant,
they brought the chef here to cook for me

419
00:40:16,600 --> 00:40:18,600
I'm no different from a prisoner!

420
00:40:18,600 --> 00:40:21,200
I care about you, that's why

421
00:40:21,600 --> 00:40:28,600
Bandits have been running amok
in the vicinity of Ping'an Town lately

422
00:40:28,600 --> 00:40:30,600
I have to be extra careful

423
00:40:31,600 --> 00:40:36,600
What if anything happens to you
and I'm not around?

424
00:40:52,600 --> 00:40:55,200
Marry me, Your Highness!

425
00:40:58,600 --> 00:41:01,600
You said you'd protect me.
How will you do that?

426
00:41:01,600 --> 00:41:05,600
By locking me up in your residence
all day?

427
00:41:06,600 --> 00:41:10,600
You know I don't mean that

428
00:41:12,600 --> 00:41:15,600
This concerns my happiness.
I need to think it over

429
00:41:15,600 --> 00:41:21,600
I must see whether you make a good
husband and are worthy of my love

430
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:26,600
I'm well-versed in both pen and sword

431
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:30,200
Who else is fit to be your husband
other than me?

432
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:36,600
Don't think you're the only talent in
the world. Wei Delu is on a par with you

433
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:40,600
How can a commoner be compared to me?

434
00:41:41,200 --> 00:41:44,600
Didn't he criticize your painting
the other time?

435
00:41:44,600 --> 00:41:46,600
He was just shooting his mouth off!

436
00:41:46,600 --> 00:41:50,600
A man like him has no taste at all.
Are you on the same level as him?

437
00:41:52,600 --> 00:41:58,200
You actually say I have no taste?
What impertinence!

438
00:41:59,200 --> 00:42:01,200
You don't get me at all

439
00:42:02,200 --> 00:42:05,200
We can't even see eye to eye
on such a small matter

440
00:42:05,200 --> 00:42:07,200
How are we going to live together?

441
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:11,600
I reject your marriage proposal.
And I'm going back to the Capital now!

442
00:42:12,600 --> 00:42:13,600
Your Highness!

443
00:42:15,600 --> 00:42:18,600
His Majesty has spoilt you

444
00:42:18,600 --> 00:42:20,600
You even dare criticize Father?

445
00:42:21,600 --> 00:42:25,600
I haven't even married you and
you're already so domineering!

446
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:28,600
-Your Excellency!
-What is it?

447
00:42:28,600 --> 00:42:30,600
Bad news!

448
00:42:30,600 --> 00:42:32,600
Where are you, Your Highness?

449
00:42:32,600 --> 00:42:34,600
Who gives you permission
to shout here?

450
00:42:35,600 --> 00:42:38,600
We're looking for Her Highness.
Where is she?

451
00:42:39,600 --> 00:42:41,200
Have a seat

452
00:42:41,200 --> 00:42:43,200
Where's Her Highness?

453
00:42:43,600 --> 00:42:47,600
She's indeed at my place

454
00:42:48,600 --> 00:42:52,600
And she enjoys her stay here.
Why are you looking for her?

455
00:42:52,600 --> 00:42:58,600
We're instructed by our master,
Golden Swallow, to protect her

456
00:42:58,600 --> 00:43:02,600
Please hand her over. Don't make
things difficult for us or else...

457
00:43:03,600 --> 00:43:05,600
Is Wei Delu here?

458
00:43:06,600 --> 00:43:08,600
Your Highness

459
00:43:09,600 --> 00:43:11,600
Are you all right, Your Highness?

460
00:43:11,600 --> 00:43:15,600
Ouyang Xiaotian won't let me go
anywhere. I'm bored to death here!

461
00:43:16,600 --> 00:43:19,600
How dare you confine Her Highness!

462
00:43:19,600 --> 00:43:23,600
Not only that, he also pressed me to
marry him! Take me away, quick!

463
00:43:24,600 --> 00:43:28,600
What a thing to say.
You're joking, aren't you?

464
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:31,600
I'm not. You shouldn't have
treated me the way you did

465
00:43:31,600 --> 00:43:37,200
Your Highness, don't worry. With us
around, he won't dare do anything to you

466
00:43:38,600 --> 00:43:41,600
See, there are many people
who care about me more than you do

467
00:43:41,600 --> 00:43:46,600
This is between Her Highness and me.
Don't interfere

468
00:43:46,600 --> 00:43:48,600
See them out

469
00:43:49,400 --> 00:43:50,400
Wait!

470
00:43:52,600 --> 00:43:58,600
I will interfere unless you stop
being difficult with Her Highness

471
00:44:00,600 --> 00:44:07,200
Do you think you're fit to interfere,
given the state you're in?

472
00:44:07,600 --> 00:44:11,200
Ouyang Xiaotian,
don't look down on him

473
00:44:11,200 --> 00:44:13,200
Wei Delu, challenge him!

474
00:44:14,600 --> 00:44:16,600
Yes, Your Highness

475
00:44:16,600 --> 00:44:21,600
Very well. Let's challenge each other
to a duel, literature and wits

476
00:44:21,600 --> 00:44:24,200
It's unfair.
I don't know martial arts

477
00:44:24,200 --> 00:44:25,600
Precisely

478
00:44:26,600 --> 00:44:29,200
We'll compete in literature then

479
00:44:29,200 --> 00:44:33,200
And your buddies and my men,
in martial arts and wits. How's that?

480
00:44:36,600 --> 00:44:39,600
Now, don't you get us involved

481
00:44:39,600 --> 00:44:41,600
You think you're his match?

482
00:44:42,600 --> 00:44:45,600
Don't worry, just leave it all to me.
All right?

483
00:44:48,600 --> 00:44:50,200
You're on

484
00:44:50,600 --> 00:44:52,600
Subtitled by Transtar Media Services


